  "In OBS, open Settings → Stream and choose WHIP as the service.": "U OBS-u otvorite Settings → Stream i za uslugu odaberite WHIP.",
  "In Settings → Output, choose the Advanced output mode. Under Streaming, keep the video encoder Simple mode had, and set the bitrate to about 2,500 kbps, Keyframe Interval to 1 s and Max B-frames to 0. Viewers coming in then get the picture within a second, and it plays smoothly in their browsers. Then press Start Streaming in OBS.": "U Settings → Output odaberite Advanced za Output Mode. Pod Streaming zadržite video enkoder iz načina Simple i postavite bitrate na oko 2.500 kbps, Keyframe Interval na 1 s i Max B-frames na 0. Novi gledatelji tada dobiju sliku unutar sekunde, a u pregledniku se reproducira bez zastoja. Zatim u OBS-u pritisnite Start Streaming.",
  "In Settings → Output, choose the Advanced output mode. Under Streaming, keep the video encoder Simple mode had, and set the bitrate to about 4,500 kbps (2,500 kbps without layers), Keyframe Interval to 1 s and Max B-frames to 0. Viewers coming in then get the picture within a second, and it plays smoothly in their browsers. Then press Start Streaming in OBS.": "U Settings → Output odaberite Advanced za Output Mode. Pod Streaming zadržite video enkoder iz načina Simple i postavite bitrate na oko 4.500 kbps (2.500 kbps bez slojeva), Keyframe Interval na 1 s i Max B-frames na 0. Novi gledatelji tada dobiju sliku unutar sekunde, a u pregledniku se reproducira bez zastoja. Zatim u OBS-u pritisnite Start Streaming.",
  "In Settings → Video, set Output (Scaled) Resolution to 1920×1080 and 30 FPS. Without layers, 1280×720 lets viewers on slow connections keep up.": "U Settings → Video postavite Output (Scaled) Resolution na 1920×1080 i 30 FPS. Bez slojeva gledatelji sa sporom vezom mogu pratiti 1280×720.",
  "In the same window, set Total Layers to 3 if your OBS has it (version 32.1 or newer). OBS then also sends smaller copies of the picture, so viewers on slow connections keep watching smoothly.": "U istom prozoru postavite Total Layers na 3 ako ga vaš OBS ima (verzija 32.1 ili novija). OBS tada šalje i manje kopije slike, pa gledatelji sa sporom vezom nastavljaju gledati bez zastoja.",
